# Go build artifacts
# NOTE: go.sum is intentionally TRACKED (Go modules integrity checksum,
# same rationale as Cargo.lock for Rust binary crates) — do not ignore it.
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
vendor/
# Local build output (just build → ./bin/, plain `go build .` → ./go-cli-urfave)
bin/
/go-cli-urfave
# VS Code debug config: re-include .vscode/ so the launch config is committed
# with the prototype (overrides a global core.excludesFile ignore of .vscode)
!.vscode/
